From: RobertGarciaa <chae0218@naver.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:58:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] skcms: provide the vendor variant required by libjxl

Complete libjxl vendor support without removing it from libjxl or libdng_sdk.
libskia_skcms has no further module dependencies to expose.

Base: 508606366e71a3daa933a4e08bc49b84e387ec18

Validation: source and dependency inspection only; no build run.
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index ff23e96..026bb79 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -1158,6 +1158,7 @@ gensrcs {
 cc_library_static {
     name: "libskia_skcms",
     host_supported: true,
+    vendor_available: true,
     sdk_version: "current",
     srcs: [
         "modules/skcms/skcms.cc",
